<section id="play" class="border-b border-line">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20">
    <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-copper">Play the stream</p>
    <h2 class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
      Any RTSP client that understands H.264.
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-paper-dim">
      TCP is the reliable default on messy networks. camrtsp does not call ffplay, VLC, or OBS
      at build or run time — they are viewers only.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-ink-2 p-6">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <h3 class="font-medium">ffplay</h3>
          <button
            type="button"
            data-copy="ffplay -rtsp_transport tcp rtsp://127.0.0.1:8554/camera"
            class="font-mono text-xs text-mute hover:text-paper"
          >
            <span data-copy-label>Copy</span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <pre class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto font-mono text-sm text-copper">ffplay -rtsp_transport tcp rtsp://127.0.0.1:8554/camera</pre>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-ink-2 p-6">
        <h3 class="font-medium">VLC and OBS</h3>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm text-paper-dim">
          <li>VLC: Media → Open Network Stream → the same URL.</li>
          <li>OBS: Media Source → input <code class="font-mono text-copper">rtsp://127.0.0.1:8554/camera</code>.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-line p-6">
      <h3 class="font-medium">With authentication</h3>
      <pre class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto font-mono text-sm leading-7 text-paper-dim">./target/release/camrtsp --camera 0 --username admin --password secret
ffplay -rtsp_transport tcp rtsp://admin:secret@127.0.0.1:8554/camera</pre>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-mute">Password may also come from <code class="font-mono">CAMRTSP_PASSWORD</code> when <code class="font-mono">--username</code> is set.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
